WEBVTT

00:05:27.073 --> 00:05:31.702
"A call-out is not
an invitation for growth.

00:05:31.744 --> 00:05:36.040
It's the expectation
that you've already grown."

00:05:36.999 --> 00:05:39.543
This is the culture we're trapped in now.

00:05:40.503 --> 00:05:42.171
On the other hand,

00:05:42.213 --> 00:05:44.423
there is calling in.

00:05:44.423 --> 00:05:47.927
"Calling in" is a phrase
invented by Loan Tran,

00:05:47.968 --> 00:05:53.307
and basically, a call-in
is a call-out done with love.

00:05:54.225 --> 00:05:56.811
So when you think somebody
has done something wrong

00:05:56.811 --> 00:05:59.021
and you want to hold them accountable,

00:05:59.021 --> 00:06:01.273
you don't react with anger or hate.